    },
    {
      "text": "<REFLECTION>",
      "section_id": "sec:introduction",
      "page_start": 1,
      "page_end": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Ai = ri −mean({r1, . . . , rG})",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "LGRP O(θ) = 1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "i=1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "DKL(πθ||πref) = πref(oi|q)",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "autoregressive manner, with the conditional probability of the entire process expressed as p(y|x, c) =",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t=1 p(yt | y<t, x, c), where y<t = [y1, . . . , yt−1] represents the generated tokens.",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "process (<SUMMARY></SUMMARY>), an image caption process (<CAPTION></CAPTION>),",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "<REASONING> To answer the question about the presence of both zebras and tigers, I first observe the animals in",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "observations, the image only contains zebras. </REASONING>",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "<REFLECTION> Let me look the image again. The distinctive striped appearance of the zebras clearly identifies them,",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Therefore, the reasoning does not conflict with the new analysis. </REFLECTION>",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "<CONCLUSION> No </CONCLUSION>",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Answer: <SUMMARY> I will determine whether both zebras and tigers are",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "shown. </SUMMARY>",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "<REFLECTION></REFLECTION>",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "<CAPTION> The image depicts a dry, open savannah environment with sparse",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "from the zebras. </CAPTION>",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "step-by-step reasoning and thinking process (<REASONING></REASONING>), reflection pro-",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "cess (<REFLECTION></REFLECTION>), and answer summarization process (<CONCLU-",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "SION></CONCLUSION>). The relative order of all processes except reflection is restricted, and",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "expressions to check if the content within <CONCLUSION></CONCLUSION> matches the correct",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": ", where Nr is the number of reflection occurrences (i.e., occurrences of <REFLEC-",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "TION></REFLECTION>), Lrtotal is the total number of tokens in all reflection processes, and λ is",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "sequence tokens is Ly, total sequence length is Ltotal = Lx + Lc + Ly. Model’s output probability is:",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "p(y|x, c) =",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "t=1",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "p(yt | y<t, x, c),",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "where y<t = [y1, . . . , yt−1]. The visual context proportion in the sequence is r =",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "(given text prompt x), i.e., I(y; c | x) = H(y | x) −H(y | x, c), where H(·) is entropy. Assuming",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "r =",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "sequence at one or multiple positions. Let k > 0 be the number of copied inserted tokens, then the",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "c = Lc +k, updated total sequence length is L′",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "total = Ltotal +k. The",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "updated visual tokens ratio becomes r′ =",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "total =",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Ltotal+k. When input text prompt length Lx > 0, we",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "have r′ > r. Therefore, the updated mutual information has upper bound I(y; c | x) ≲r′ ·H(y | x, c)",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Visual Token COPY (VTC). When the model produces a reflection process (start with <REFLEC-",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "TION> token), simply copy the input image’s visual tokens completely to the beginning of the",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "reflection process (before <REFLECTION> token). That is, the reflection process begins generating",
      "section_id": "sec:preliminaries",
      "page_start": 4,
      "page_end": 7
